{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":12501,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793432229082,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2003,"episodeCount":26,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1ihfBrym5DL1kRX3dPmORkiQGWN.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"482461","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sora dreams of becoming a star of the Kaleido Stage, but when a scumbag steals her luggage and makes her miss the only audition of the year, it will take a miracle - or an accident - for her dream to come true!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-04-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/opeu45uyihXB5EaF0uZ30HoSSGC.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/opeu45uyihXB5EaF0uZ30HoSSGC.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"482463","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sora is given one week to learn the death-defying Golden Phoenix: the signature move of the Kaleido Stage’s leading lady. If she fails, she’ll be forced to pack up and return home forever!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-04-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zPMQlu1lqAPu1ndL8szXNEI9j4G.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zPMQlu1lqAPu1ndL8szXNEI9j4G.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"482462","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Kaleido Stage is putting on a fabulous production of Cinderella, but instead of performing on stage, Sora is forced to dress up like a clown and hand out toys during intermission. Can she contain her disappointment?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-04-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qbc8oDjw8h95HqbIE9m9ZveM5F7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qbc8oDjw8h95HqbIE9m9ZveM5F7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"482464","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sora gets a second chance to appear in the upcoming production of Cinderella, but she’ll need to master a daring, three-person technique known as the Triple Illusion to earn a spot on stage!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-05-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1auTdO7TQvCwVmyZvh9mtOI92KY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1auTdO7TQvCwVmyZvh9mtOI92KY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"482479","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sora and her friends are stung by their failures on stage and a nasty review in the local paper. As if things couldn’t get any worse, Sora’s dad is about to pay her a visit, and he’s no fan of her Kaleido Stage shenanigans!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-05-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pedHylx2PivOrdGoYiIEo4HhEbx.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pedHylx2PivOrdGoYiIEo4HhEbx.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"482480","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Pets may be forbidden in her dorm, but when Sora stumbles upon an abandoned seal, she can’t resist the urge to bring the little guy home with her! Does her new pet have what it takes to be a new breed of Kaleido Star?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-05-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i4uy0OCgzhtKsfuJXhKP68KHAI9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i4uy0OCgzhtKsfuJXhKP68KHAI9.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"482465","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When a Diablo prodigy blows her big shot at becoming a Kaleido Stage regular, Sora is given the task of helping the young girl rediscover her love of performing!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-05-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f7U13OBW6IXasY82Vw70QanIcvg.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f7U13OBW6IXasY82Vw70QanIcvg.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"482481","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Layla appears to have everything a girl could want. She’s rich, she’s gorgeous, and she’s the biggest star in the Kaleido Stage universe! But when her dad misses her birthday, it’ll take Sora to cheer her up!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-05-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/byIK4coFgW1Sq4FpV2jzRIZTI08.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/byIK4coFgW1Sq4FpV2jzRIZTI08.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"482482","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When Sora suffers a devastating fall during an audition for the new, mermaid-themed production, she’ll need the help of a close friend and a martial arts expert to regain her competitive edge!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-05-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1vyjUd52E3pQtSKysqNngt0xLaU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1vyjUd52E3pQtSKysqNngt0xLaU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"482483","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sora finally landed the part that could make her wildest dreams come true, but if she can’t figure out a way to breathe new life into the role of a broken-hearted mermaid, her days as a leading lady will be numbered!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-06-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/d9eux6tnJrshtY3ZwUL6ueeycI5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d9eux6tnJrshtY3ZwUL6ueeycI5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"482484","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Painful memories from Anna’s childhood resurface when her dad - a struggling standup comedian - performs at a local comedy club. Can this father-daughter duo find a way to laugh at the past?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-06-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mswMdMEgx424ciJXJyciSxegVTf.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mswMdMEgx424ciJXJyciSxegVTf.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"482485","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sora has always idolized Layla, and now, she’s got a chance to star alongside her hero in the newest Kaleido Stage production. There’s just one thing standing in her way: a flaming tightrope of doom!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-06-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7pSjBdsWce4ZPvAeNlhgxLCzHtU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7pSjBdsWce4ZPvAeNlhgxLCzHtU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"482486","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Layla moves in with Sora so the two leading ladies can learn to perform as one. When conventional training proves useless, the girls take their routine to the high seas and put on a show in the middle of a storm!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-06-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jjcLSbuYw7kEhVy4v5RYOe8lWuO.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jjcLSbuYw7kEhVy4v5RYOe8lWuO.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"482487","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When Sora is sent on a special assignment to perform with a travelling circus, she learns a valuable lesson about making the audience happy - no matter what role you have to play.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-07-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aXgzaROAG5LsF08zqFW6MbZLc2o.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aXgzaROAG5LsF08zqFW6MbZLc2o.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"482466","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sarah is courted by a music producer who wants to make her a star, but Sora can’t understand why she’d want to leave Kaleido Stage - or how Kalos could let her go.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-07-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hQKn9rMsAAcVl0YrUFj4IWLkLV3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hQKn9rMsAAcVl0YrUFj4IWLkLV3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"482488","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A bossy friend from Japan makes Sora nervous when she pays the Kaleido Star a surprise visit. Meanwhile, rumors about a possible Kaleido closing put the cast on edge.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-07-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qxjHOOxxMCHy8odEj0RNHGUxZo1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qxjHOOxxMCHy8odEj0RNHGUxZo1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"482489","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mia is given one week to write the show that will save Kaleido Stage, and Yuri finally tells Sora the painful motive behind his attempt to sabotage the man who made him a star.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-07-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7apAyXQd95kq33UiPDcLrhTh6Ln.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7apAyXQd95kq33UiPDcLrhTh6Ln.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"482490","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mia’s new show is a hit with the audience, but Kaleido Stage isn’t out of the woods, yet. Now that Yuri’s in charge, Sora and her friends must prepare for what could be their last performance ever.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-07-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hZNe4DaL5xOPqBO3HpHHoB9Y9ql.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hZNe4DaL5xOPqBO3HpHHoB9Y9ql.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"482491","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sora’s search for a new place to live is interrupted by big news from Japan: her parents are going to have a baby! Will this new addition to her family put an end to the leading lady’s performing career?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-08-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z3hkcU5BhmDL2XrOd2cSiafsSx5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z3hkcU5BhmDL2XrOd2cSiafsSx5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12501/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"482492","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Miss Sarah lands the girls a gig at an amusement park, and Sora reassembles the old gang for one more shot at stardom! When the show finally starts, a masked performer swoops in and steals the spotlight!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-08-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kytNoS2jxIxqQzAF5Y0E0Q6Tzhp.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kytNoS2jxIxqQzAF5Y0E0Q6Tzhp.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUr